# Harness/agent WORK BRAIN — committed so another machine can continue the work seamlessly.
# .sessions/: keep ONLY the durable handoff docs; ignore all the churny scratch
#   (cycle_*.json, session_0NN.json, token/ledger files, gather/compact scratch, trace files).
/.sessions/*
!/.sessions/active_thread.md
!/.sessions/session_handoff.md
!/.sessions/mece_plan.md
!/.sessions/reflections.md
# knowledge/: keep the spec/reference docs (.md); ignore the auto-regenerated JSON indexes.
/knowledge/*
!/knowledge/*.md
# NOTE: /docs/ (master_roadmap + design), /CODING_FAILURE_PATTERNS.md, /REPO_MAP.md,
# /INVARIANTS.md are intentionally NO LONGER ignored — they are the deliberate work brain
# and now travel with git push/pull.

